+# Windows pointer observer regression tests
+
+Run from the NativeScript source checkout with Node 22.13+ (TypeScript stripping):
+
+```sh
+node --test packages/core/ui/gestures/tests/*.windows.test.mjs
+```
+
+The tests execute the actual Windows observer TypeScript with a mocked native
+bridge and controlled timers. They also execute the pinned original source from
+Git to reproduce the replacement collision and spurious touch callback.
+They establish registration ownership and gesture state logic, not native hit
+testing, capture ordering, or WinRT projection correctness. OS verification is
+recorded separately in the octane-xplat Windows lab notes.
